# PureOptionsBot v2.0 - Comprehensive Audit & Gap Analysis

## Executive Summary

After thorough comparison between the **old bot** ([live_trader.py](file:///c:/Rahul/06_Nikku/Strategies/PureOptionsBot/live_trader.py), 1675 lines) and the **new modular bot** ([main.py](file:///c:/Rahul/06_Nikku/Strategies/PureOptionsBot/main.py) + [core/engine.py](file:///c:/Rahul/06_Nikku/Strategies/PureOptionsBot/core/engine.py)), I've identified significant gaps. The new bot has a solid architectural foundation but is missing critical functionality to be production-ready.

---
